  "contexts": {
    "medium": "Add nutritional supplements if necessary. Adjust pH to 6.5 with 1M NaOH. Make to 1 liter with distilled water. For solid medium add 18 g agar. Autoclave.",
    "nitrate": "Add distilled water to 1 liter. Autoclave. Store at 4oC.",
    "trace": "Add the compounds in order. Boil. Cool to 60oC. Adjust pH to 6.5 with KOH. Cool to room temperature. Adjust volume to 100 ml with distilled water. With storage this forms a purple solution with a rusty brown precipitate that should be resuspended before use."
